00:02:36.269 --> 00:02:40.389
Hank Green and the Perfect Strangers will
also be playing at VidCon. VIDCOOOOOOOON.

00:02:40.389 --> 00:02:44.549
Which reminds me if you haven't got your VidCon
tickets yet, you need to do that right now

00:02:44.549 --> 00:02:49.279
because we're 95% sold out and I would love
for as many nerdfighters to be there as possible,

00:02:49.279 --> 00:02:50.409
because I like you.

00:02:50.409 --> 00:02:54.779
If you aren't aware of what VidCon is, it's
an annual meet-up of people who love online

00:02:54.779 --> 00:03:01.260
video, uh, with concerts and panels and discussions
of the culture and business of online video

00:03:01.260 --> 00:03:07.930
and performances and Q&amp;As and signings, and
it's generally a really fun time. It's in

00:03:07.930 --> 00:03:13.760
Anaheim, and it's from June 26th to June 28th.
So three days of VidCon this year, guys. I'm

00:03:13.760 --> 00:03:18.079
super excited about it. I am ALSO super overwhelmed
by it, but that's life.

00:03:18.079 --> 00:03:24.430
To people who don't live in the Western United
States: I'm sorry. It's hard to get away for

00:03:24.430 --> 00:03:27.829
more than a couple of weeks when you have
SciShow and Crash Course and all the other

00:03:27.829 --> 00:03:32.609
projects and people that we need to keep happy
and healthy here in Missoula. I like making

00:03:32.609 --> 00:03:36.639
those things for the internet because everyone
can have them no matter where you live, but

00:03:36.639 --> 00:03:42.449
if you ARE in the Western United States: lucky
duck. The rest of you - I'm here, on the internet,

00:03:42.449 --> 00:03:43.079
always.

00:03:43.079 --> 00:03:47.959
Hope you like this song. John, I'll see you
on Tuesday.

